# Whitelist: only the kinds of files this project writes can be committed, so game
# data (.toc, .sb, .cas, the executables) never ends up in the repository by accident.
# To track a new kind of file, add it here deliberately.
*
!*/
/target/

!.gitignore
!.local-ci
!LICENSE
!Cargo.lock
!*.toml
!*.rs
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.py
# Shaders, compiled to SPIR-V by crates/render/build.rs.
!*.wgsl
# The progress page's template (scripts/publish-progress.sh fills it).
!scripts/progress_page.html
# The views bench/history.sh renders for the progress page.
!bench/history-views.txt
